Meta Perception Encoder Core S/16 384 (PE-Core-S-16-384)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
The bundled image and text encoder is derived from Meta Platforms' Perception
Encoder models, converted to Core ML and redistributed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0.

Source: https://github.com/facebookresearch/perception_models
License: Support/VisualModelPacks/meta-pe-core-s-16-384/<revision>/LICENSE.PE

The model directory also contains a byte pair encoding vocabulary used by the
text encoder.

